    "title": "Flatten a Binary Tree into a Linked List",
    "category": "Trees",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the root of a binary tree, transform it into a singly linked list in preorder traversal order using the existing tree nodes. Each node in the resulting list must have its left child set to null.",
